<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>London Makeup Artist</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

:root {
  --bg: #06080d;
  --surface: #0d1117;
  --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  --text: #e8eaf0;
  --muted: #7a8597;
  --pink: #ff5fa2;
  --pink-dim: rgba(255,95,162,0.12);
}

body {
  font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

body::before {
  content: '';
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 40px 40px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
  align-items: center;
  gap: 60px;
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 80px 40px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.hero-text {
  animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards;
}

.eyebrow {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pink);
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 78px);
  line-height: 0.95;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
}

.hero h1 span {
  color: var(--pink);
}

.subtitle {
  margin-top: 24px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  max-width: 560px;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
}

.price-grid {
  margin-top: 40px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
}

.price-card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 24px;
  transition: 0.25s ease;
}

.price-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  border-color: rgba(255,95,162,0.3);
}

.price-title {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.price-value {
  font-size: 34px;
  color: var(--pink);
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.price-desc {
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
}

.actions {
  margin-top: 34px;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 14px;
}

.btn {
  padding: 14px 24px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: 0.25s ease;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--pink);
  color: #fff;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  opacity: 0.9;
}

.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  color: var(--text);
}

.btn-secondary:hover {
  border-color: rgba(255,95,162,0.3);
  color: var(--pink);
}

.hero-image {
  position: relative;
  animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards;
}

.hero-image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 700px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 28px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.floating-card {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 24px;
  left: 24px;
  background: rgba(13,17,23,0.9);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 18px 22px;
}

.floating-card small {
  display: block;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
}

.floating-card strong {
  font-size: 18px;
}

.services {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 40px 100px;
}

.services-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: var(--pink);
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.services-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}

.service-card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 28px;
  transition: 0.25s ease;
}

.service-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  border-color: rgba(255,95,162,0.25);
}

.service-icon {
  font-size: 28px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.service-card h3 {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  font-size: 18px;
}

.service-card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.7;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
}

@keyframes fadeUp {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .hero {
    padding: 60px 24px;
  }

  .services {
    padding: 0 24px 80px;
  }

  .hero-image img {
    height: 500px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <div class="eyebrow">/ London Makeup Artist</div>

    <h1>
      Luxury <span>Makeup</span><br>
      Services
    </h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
      Professional makeup artist based in London offering bridal glam,
      party makeup, photoshoot looks and luxury beauty services for every occasion.
    </p>

    <div class="price-grid">
      <div class="price-card">
        <div class="price-title">Full Makeup Service</div>
        <div class="price-value">£1000</div>
        <div class="price-desc">
          Luxury full glam makeup including premium products and personalised styling.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="price-card">
        <div class="price-title">Hourly Booking</div>
        <div class="price-value">£100+</div>
        <div class="price-desc">
          Flexible hourly bookings for events, parties and touch-up sessions.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary">Book Appointment</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary">View Services</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-image">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412720507-e7ab37603c6f?q=80&w=1400&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Makeup Artist">

    <div class="floating-card">
      <small>Based In</small>
      <strong>London, United Kingdom</strong>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services">
  <div class="services-title">Services</div>

  <div class="services-grid">
    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">💄</div>
      <h3>Bridal Makeup</h3>
      <p>
        Elegant bridal makeup designed for weddings, receptions and luxury events.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">✨</div>
      <h3>Party Glam</h3>
      <p>
        Full glam makeup looks for birthdays, parties, celebrations and night events.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">📸</div>
      <h3>Photoshoots</h3>
      <p>
        Camera-ready makeup styling for professional shoots, fashion and content creation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services">
  <div class="services-title">Bridal Portfolio</div>

  <div class="services-grid">
    <div class="service-card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524504388940-b1c1722653e1?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Indian Bridal Makeup" style="width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:18px;">
      <h3>Traditional Bridal Glam</h3>
      <p>Luxury Indian bridal makeup with elegant jewellery styling and flawless glam finish.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515886657613-9f3515b0c78f?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Party Makeup" style="width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:18px;">
      <h3>Reception Makeup</h3>
      <p>Soft glam and modern bridal makeup looks perfect for receptions and evening events.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service-card">
      <video controls autoplay muted loop playsinline style="width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:18px;">
        <source src="https://cdn.coverr.co/videos/coverr-applying-makeup-1560671951894?download=1080p" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
      <h3>Bridal Makeup Reel</h3>
      <p>Short cinematic beauty reel showcasing premium bridal makeup artistry and styling.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</body>
</html>

